# Never commit Circle wallet recovery files or entity secrets.
# Patterns target Circle's SDK-emitted filenames (recovery_file_*.dat,
# entity_secret_*.txt). Do NOT broaden to `recovery*` — it would catch
# our source folder packages/core/src/recovery/.
